WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.048 --> 00:00:06.425
"Oh no!" Ivy thought as she and Glen ran to Ezra.

2
00:00:06.426 --> 00:00:10.878
By accident, he'd switched on the PA system with his elbow.

3
00:00:10.879 --> 00:00:14.207
Glen reached over and turned off the switch.

4
00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:18.880
Ezra quickly said good-bye to his parents and ended his call.

5
00:00:18.881 --> 00:00:25.752
He looked panicked. "Did everyone in camp just hear my phone call?"

6
00:00:25.753 --> 00:00:30.235
"Um, only part of it," Ivy said.

7
00:00:30.236 --> 00:00:37.574
"Yeah, only part of it." Glen patted him on the back. "The worst part."

8
00:00:37.575 --> 00:00:41.920
"Ugh!" Ezra groaned.

9
00:00:41.921 --> 00:00:47.252
Glen grabbed some more brownies and put the box away.

10
00:00:47.253 --> 00:00:54.292
"Here, Ezra, have a brownie. Actually—have four brownies."

11
00:00:54.293 --> 00:01:00.977
Ezra tried to eat one, but he was too worried. "I feel sick."

12
00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:06.365
So Glen ate the brownies for him.

13
00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:09.927
The kids left the office.

14
00:01:09.928 --> 00:01:14.664
Outside, the Ucks were waiting along with Clara and Willow.

15
00:01:14.665 --> 00:01:18.504
"Hey, Snuggy Wuggy!" Chuck yelled.

16
00:01:18.505 --> 00:01:21.014
The Ucks roared with laughter.

17
00:01:21.015 --> 00:01:26.406
"Do you miss your mommy and daddy, Snuggy Wuggy?" Huck asked.

18
00:01:26.407 --> 00:01:29.128
Clara frowned at the three boys.

19
00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:33.541
"I think it's sweet that Ezra misses his parents."

20
00:01:33.542 --> 00:01:36.616
"Me too!" Willow said.

21
00:01:36.617 --> 00:01:39.579
That just made the Ucks laugh harder.

22
00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:44.181
Ivy looked at Ezra and saw that his face was bright red.

23
00:01:44.182 --> 00:01:47.537
"Cut it out," she said to the Ucks.

24
00:01:47.538 --> 00:01:52.858
"Hey, where's our candy?" Huck asked, holding out his hand.

25
00:01:52.859 --> 00:01:59.026
Ivy crossed her arms. "You're not getting any candy from us!"

26
00:01:59.027 --> 00:02:02.415
"Ha-ha! Ivy's kidding," Glen said.

27
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:05.419
"See, here's your candy."

28
00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:10.287
He emptied his pockets and gave the other campers all his candy.

29
00:02:10.288 --> 00:02:14.097
"Thanks, Glen!" Clara and Willow said together.

30
00:02:14.098 --> 00:02:21.212
The Ucks didn't thank him because they were too busy stuffing candy into their mouths.

31
00:02:21.213 --> 00:02:25.344
Soon Mrs. Matsak returned from inspecting the cabins.

32
00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:28.879
The kids quickly hid their candy behind their backs.

33
00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:32.625
"Private wants everyone at the ball field," she said. "It's

34
00:02:32.626 --> 00:02:36.145
time for the baseball game!" ***

35
00:02:36.146 --> 00:02:39.633
When the game started, Ivy was in right field.

36
00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:42.144
Glen was playing center field.

37
00:02:42.145 --> 00:02:44.965
Ivy moved closer to Glen.

38
00:02:44.966 --> 00:02:48.618
"I can't believe you gave all your candy to the Ucks!

39
00:02:48.619 --> 00:02:51.615
They were teasing Ezra."

40
00:02:51.616 --> 00:02:54.131
Glen kicked at the grass.

41
00:02:54.132 --> 00:02:58.240
"I . . . didn't give them all my candy.

42
00:02:58.241 --> 00:03:01.195
You still have some in your pockets."

43
00:03:01.196 --> 00:03:07.622
Ivy glared at him. "Yeah, I do, and you're not getting it back!

44
00:03:07.623 --> 00:03:10.124
You'll just waste it on the Ucks."

45
00:03:10.125 --> 00:03:13.820
Ezra was on the other team, and now he was at bat.

46
00:03:13.821 --> 00:03:18.631
He stepped up to the plate.

47
00:03:18.632 --> 00:03:23.025
"Snuggy Wuggy! Snuggy Wuggy!"

48
00:03:23.026 --> 00:03:27.054
Chuck chanted from third base.

49
00:03:27.055 --> 00:03:30.409
Ezra swung and missed.

50
00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:38.053
Now more kids were chanting. "Snuggy Wuggy! Snuggy Wuggy!"

51
00:03:38.054 --> 00:03:40.670
Ezra quickly got two more strikes.

52
00:03:40.671 --> 00:03:43.037
He was out.

53
00:03:43.038 --> 00:03:47.775
Slowly he walked back to the bench and slumped down.

54
00:03:47.776 --> 00:03:50.873
Ivy punched her fist into her glove.

55
00:03:50.874 --> 00:03:54.315
"I want to teach the Ucks a lesson somehow!"

56
00:03:54.316 --> 00:04:00.392
"What will you teach them? I don't think they like drawing," Glen said.

57
00:04:00.393 --> 00:04:03.933
"We have to stop them," Ivy said.

58
00:04:03.934 --> 00:04:05.878
"They're bullies.

59
00:04:05.879 --> 00:04:10.855
They took all your candy, and they won't stop teasing Ezra.

60
00:04:10.856 --> 00:04:13.346
Maybe we could scare them!"

61
00:04:13.347 --> 00:04:17.663
"The Ucks didn't take my candy. I gave it to them.

62
00:04:17.664 --> 00:04:21.517
And now they're my friends," Glen said.

63
00:04:21.518 --> 00:04:24.996
"I can just talk to them and tell them to leave Ezra alone.

64
00:04:24.997 --> 00:04:27.467
They'll listen to me."

65
00:04:27.468 --> 00:04:29.717
Ivy raised one eyebrow.

66
00:04:29.718 --> 00:04:34.782
"Oh, really? That's all it takes . . . a little chat?"

67
00:04:34.783 --> 00:04:39.805
"Yep!" Glen said. "Just wait. You'll see."

68
00:04:39.806 --> 00:04:43.120
Huck was the next batter.

69
00:04:43.121 --> 00:04:48.081
As the ball crossed the plate, he swung the bat, making a loud crack.

70
00:04:48.082 --> 00:04:49.775
The ball popped up.

71
00:04:49.776 --> 00:04:56.924
It was heading to the outfield, right toward Ivy and Glen!

